# A little sofa that appears when the duck sits down with the newspaper after a coffee. The back is
# drawn behind the duck and the seat with its armrests in front, so the duck sinks into it.
name: sofa
size: 32x23
palette:
  K #2a1f2d
  L #d9705a
  R #b5473a
  D #7e2f2a

@frame sofa-back
